# ---- moved in-tree 2026-09-22, NEVER commit ----
# This repo is PUBLIC. Both folders lived outside it until now; they are kept
# here for convenience and are ignored by path, by name at any depth, and with
# trailing-slash and bare variants so a rename or a nested copy stays covered.
# Verify after touching this file:  git check-ignore -v _secrets client-docs
/_secrets
/_secrets/
_secrets/
/client-docs
/client-docs/
client-docs/
# Belt and braces: plaintext credential notes wherever they land.
**/supa_prd_password.md
**/*password*.md
